[["heading","SECTION 24 / PRACTICAL PROJECT\nTeam login feature — local simulation"],["sinhala","","Temporary folders Jදකක GitHub remote එකකේ simulate කර feature branch, push සහ merge",476],["sinhala","","practice කරන්න. Real account එකකේ අවශ්‍ය නැහැ.",254],["text","Run in a new empty practice directory, using a POSIX shell. This creates a bare remote and a\nworking repository."],["code","git init --bare --initial-branch=main remote.git\ngit init -b main app\ncd app\ngit config user.name \"Practice Developer\"\ngit config user.email \"practice@example.com\"\nprintf 'Login demo\\n' > README.md\ngit add README.md\ngit commit -m \"Initial README\"\ngit remote add origin ../remote.git\ngit push -u origin main\ngit switch -c feature/login\nprintf 'export const login = true;\\n' > login.js\ngit add login.js\ngit commit -m \"Add login feature\"\ngit push -u origin feature/login\ngit switch main\ngit merge --no-ff feature/login -m \"Merge login feature\"\ngit push origin main\ngit log --oneline --graph --all"],["text","Expected: Three commits: initial README, login feature, merge commit. The remote main points at the\nmerge commit. Commit IDs vary."],["heading","Initial README"],["heading","main + origin/main"],["heading","A"],["heading","M"],["heading","Merge login feature"],["heading","B"],["heading","Login feature"]]